   "text": "NORTHLINE METRORAILCORPORATION\nSafety Department ·NMR/SAF/2026/041·Dated: 6 August 2026\nSubject: Fire safety audit of all elevated stations and compliance reporting\n1. Background\nThe annual fire safety audit of the elevated corridor found expired portable extinguishers at eleven stations and two partially functional smoke detection loops. This circular sets out what each department must do and by when.\n2. Fire extinguishing equipment\nEvery Station Controller shall replace all expired portable extinguishers and certify the replacement to the Safety Department on or before 21 August 2026.",
