   "rotation": 0.0,
   "text": "3. Evacuation drills\nQuarterly evacuation drills are mandatory at every station. The Operations Control Centre must complete the pending drills and report to the Chief Safety Officer not later than 31 August 2026.\n4.Smoke detection\nThe Signalling and Telecom department is responsible for restoring both faulty smoke detection loops. Until restoration, a fire watch is required at the affected platforms during all service hours. Station staff were retrained on extinguisher handling in July, and attendance records are held by HumanResources for inspection.",
